  text: "Need to verify which realm the Well of Mimir sits in. The Hávamál says Jotunheim, but Eddas disagree. Ask Bifrost."

q1:
  type: question
  author: Josii
  status: unresolved
  created: "2026-04-17T13:05:00Z"
  text: "The line feels flat. Odin should be angrier. Consider: 'I bled on that altar. I gave the price before I knew its weight. And now you speak of it like pocket change.'"

q2:
  type: praise
  author: Josii
  status: resolved
  created: "2026-04-17T13:06:00Z"
  text: "Love this image. The tree as both anchor and threat."

q3:
  type: rewrite
  author: Josii
  status: unresolved
  created: "2026-04-17T13:10:00Z"
  text: "Fenrir introduction is too abrupt. Build tension first — sound of claws on bark, a shadow, then the reveal. The audience knows he's coming. Make them wait."

